  "d.10azxrl": "Tri sola rediys antap long fotosfia. Sed i laef: sild blong flatfom, komet, ol bigfala hul. Ol flea oli kam evri sam minit.",
  "d.10wlatv": "Wan kala wea yu jusum wea janel blong hem wea i hae moa i les long 0x40 i rid olsem STOCK, olsem wan sild i no save kam invisibol.",
  "d.11cuwtu": "OL ROKIT",
  "d.11jyj1n": "Wan destroia wea i bildim raon long wan medium relgan long baksaed, wetem ol taret blong lasa mo sikistin sel blong rokit.",
