  "d.1436q76": "Vesen 0.5.1 i fros: ples blong ol wepon, sut blong sikis rokit wanwan afta long narafala, mo wan hanga blong ANVIL wea i lonjem 10 NEEDLE.",
  "d.14s5uo6": "Ol pluum blong injin long wan sip blong kapital mo wan faeta. Pikja long gem, vesen 0.5.3",
  "d.14vqvyw": "ANVIL wetem hanga blong hem i open. Pikja long gem, vesen 0.6.1",
  "d.14zbb1f": "Wan smol faeta anda long faea blong wan wing blong enemi long asteroid fil blong THETA-7, bubol blong sild blong hem i saen.",
