  "d.16sui9e": "Bigfala sip blong lida wea i bigwan olsem wan taon, wetem wan drom blong ples blong stap wea i tanem, tufala hevi relgan long baksaed mo plante gan olsem wan bus.",
  "d.177y6xj": "Tufala boost.",
