  "d.1bt06ve": "Relgan long baksaed: holem blong jaj, lusum blong sut.",
  "d.1c3ocas": "FREE FOL",
  "d.1c7mz24": "Aena blong boks 16 km long 12 km, selen wea i sof i 2.7 km.",
  "d.1c9et86": "Vesen 0.5.2 i fros: ol stans blong skwadron, wan saen ROCKETS INCOMING mo ol sea blong taret.",
  "d.1czllhs": "KRUSA",
  "d.1dlvg7e": "SMOL FAETA",
  "d.1dlyq4f": "420 km antap long naet saed, tri minit bifo san i kamap long orbit. Ashgrove Station, rabis blong wan taem wea samting i brokbrok, mo ol laet blong Yurop oli slaed i go anda.",
  "d.1dmfq0q": "Toolchain i joenem long gem",
  "d.1e2mh2n": "Muv i go long Unreal Engine 5 i wan raetem bakegen.",
  "d.1e63f23": "Win i holem yu.",
  "d.1ea9win": "Wan faet-krusa wea i lusum ama blong gat wan bigfala saed blong drive mo tufala hevi relgan long baksaed.",
  "d.1eoopdx": "Ol rokit blong lok-on: wan rokit i gat gid sapos lok blong hem i finis taem i lonj.",
