  "d.1fslkx6": "ANVIL i lonjem ten NEEDLE blong fren long hanga blong hem.",
  "d.1ggqqf2": "FAET-KRUSA",
  "d.1gjlmo6": "THETA-7 ASTEROID FIELD: wan fil blong ston wea i nogud mo wan san wea i longwe i putum laet long hem.",
