  "d.nuhm57": "Et kaen sip, ol lasa mo sut blong plante, mo asteroid fil blong THETA-7.",
  "d.p1uh6f": "Protaep i stat long injin open-sos (GPL) blong Quake III Arena, wetem ol sip blong Elite Dangerous olsem tingting blong hem.",
  "d.pimdbg": "Vesen 0.4.0 i fros: wan luk wea i olsem tru: laet wea i stap long pikja, ples wea laet i no kasem, mo soft sado blong san.",
  "d.pp01v0": "NEEDLE olsem i soem long menu blong hanga blong gem, hul blong vesen 0.6.1, lukluk blong tri-kota long blak.",
