  "d.r70f4w": "THETA-7 wetem skae mo ston blong 0.5.0. Pikja long gem, vesen 0.5.0",
  "d.rap4k0": "BRAWLER, pikja blong hanga long menu blong gem (hul olsem oli mekem blong 0.3.0 mo afta; saes blong stat 256 x 128). Pikja long gem, vesen 0.6.1",
  "d.reost1": "Wan faeta wetem sild i sutem wan bim blong lasa long wan boks blong target.",
  "d.rexwmq": "Holem trigga blong sut. Ol grup blong sut blong sip oli tanem evri refaea intaval, mo evri fiks gan mo taret blong lasa long grup naoia oli sut.",
  "d.sdtkzv": "Skrin LOADOUT blong ORION-1 wetem ol tia blong hul mo sild, kala blong sild mo ol rou blong ples blong wepon.",
