  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "Anthropic, Claude mo Claude Code oli trednem blong Anthropic, PBC. Unreal Engine mo Epic Games oli trednem blong Epic Games, Inc. Blender i trednem blong Blender Foundation. Quake III Arena mo Elite Dangerous oli trednem blong ona blong olgeta. Evri nem oli blong ona blong olgeta mo oli yusum blong soem ol prodakt nomo. Orion-81 i no joen wetem, i no gat spona long, mo i no sapotem eni long olgeta.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Hop nomo. I no gat patnaship, joen o sapot.",
