  "footer.futurePartners": "Ol patna long fiuja?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "I no gat traka. I no gat kuki. Saet blong lukluk. Evri fakt i go long arkaev blong proejek; i no gat wan samting long ples ya wea i wan ofa o wan promis.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "I no stap laev yet",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Wan samting i stap open yet: <0>jek blong laesens<\/0> blong kod blong gem wea i kam long GPL protaep. Wan otomatik skan blong kod agensem sos blong protaep i ron long <1/>, mo ol ekspet oli stap jekem ol samting wea skan i faenem.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>Orion-81 i wan proejek wea AI nomo i mekem olgeta samting.<\/0> Kod blong Orion-81 hem seleva, Claude Code i raetem, man blong stanemap i givim rod; ol sip, map, tekstja mo saon, ol tul wea Claude Code i raetem oli mekem. Ol laebri open-sos wea hem i yusum oli stap andanit long <1>'AI i no mekem'<\/1>.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Futa blong saet",
  "hero.behindThisPlate": "Bihaen long plet ya: modol ORION-1 blong gem long vesen 0.6.1, i ron laev long brauza blong yu (oli senisim blong yusum long wep, tekstja i smol kasem 512 px).",
