  "why.anthropic": "Blong Anthropic",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic": "<0>Ekonomik Indeks blong Anthropic (<1/>)<\/0> i faenem se ol man wea oli stat nomo long wok oli luk se plante long wok blong olgeta AI i save mekem.",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic2": "<0>Frem blong polisi blong ekonomi blong Anthropic (<1/>)<\/0> i askem ol kompani blong tijim bakegen mo putum ol man long narafala wok, i no katem olgeta.",
  "why.anthropicSReview": "<0>Lukluk blong Anthropic long ol pruf blong tijim bakegen (<1/>)<\/0> i faenem se ol program wea oli joen wetem ol bos mo oli blong wan sekta nomo oli wok gud moa.",
  "why.askSimpleFive": "Askem i isi: faef sea blong Claude blong stat. Sapos man blong stanemap i save fulumap olgeta wetem ol man wea oli gat talen mo oli gat strong tingting, bae mifala i soem olsem wanem man i save yusum AI wetem gud tingting blong mekem wan samting wea i naes.",
  "why.context": "Kontekst",
  "why.designersEngineers": "Blong ol disaena mo ol injinia",
  "why.everyItemBelow": "Evri samting andanit i wan plan o oli no talem yet. I no gat wan samting long ples ya wea oli agri long hem, mo oli no promisim wan namba.",
  "why.founderWentFrom": "Wan man blong stanemap i go long protaep kasem 0.6.1 long <0/> dei. Tingbaot wanem wan tim wea i givim olgeta blong olgeta, faef man, i save mekem.",
  "why.fromAnthropic": "Long Anthropic",
